# Loan Approval MLOps Pipeline

## System Architecture
This repository implements an end-to-end MLOps pipeline for loan approval prediction:
- **DVC**: Tracks data versioning and pipeline execution (`dvc.yaml`).
- **MLflow**: Tracks experiment parameters, metrics, and model artifacts.
- **FastAPI**: Exposes model inference via REST endpoints (`/predict`).
- **Docker**: Containers package the application runtime.
- **GitHub Actions**: Automated CI/CD for unit testing and pushing Docker images to Docker Hub.

## Quick Start (Local Run)
```bash
docker pull deepthikota12/loan-approval-api:latest
docker run -d -p 8000:8000 --name loan-app deepthikota12/loan-approval-api:latest
